{"publicId":"b02e30d3-148b-4ee8-9d65-fb101fd40633","title":"Anthropic启动IPO路演 计划募资最高643.5亿美元","status":"active","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-18T00:35:40.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-18T00:35:40.000Z","digest":"Anthropic于2026年11月10日启动A类普通股首次公开募股（IPO）路演，计划发行8.25亿股，发行价区间每股70–78美元，按上限计算基础募资规模最高达643.5亿美元（36氪2026-11-10、11-11报道）。第三方媒体称其IPO目标估值为1万亿美元（36氪2026-11-10报道），但Anthropic未官方确认此估值。市场反应方面，彭博新闻援引迪拜富豪侯赛因·萨吉瓦尼称投资Anthropic等AI公司或获数十亿美元回报，并称路演期间已获大量认购意向（36氪2026-11-12报道）。此外，红杉资本、光速创投等现有风投股东计划在IPO中追加投资（36氪2026-11-18新报道）。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-18T01:12:17.928Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"Anthropic现有风投股东计划在IPO中追加投资","latestReport":{"id":"wezsi6dasxzqt6af44n8fyf7k"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":1,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fRtIJtUyy3Go","title":"红杉资本与光速创投拟在Anthropic IPO中追加投资","firstReportAt":"2026-11-18T00:35:40.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"wezsi6dasxzqt6af44n8fyf7k","title":"Anthropic现有风投股东计划在IPO中追加投资","summary":"红杉资本、光速创投等现有风投股东计划在Anthropic即将进行的IPO中投入更多资金，表明对该公司持续看好。","source":{"name":"36氪","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-18T00:35:40.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"wezsi6dasxzqt6af44n8fyf7k","title":"Anthropic现有风投股东计划在IPO中追加投资","summary":"红杉资本、光速创投等现有风投股东计划在Anthropic即将进行的IPO中投入更多资金，表明对该公司持续看好。","source":{"name":"36氪","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-18T00:35:40.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-11T21:00:00.000Z","heat":5.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T22:00:00.000Z","heat":5.2,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T23:00:00.000Z","heat":5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-12T00:00:00.000Z","heat":4.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-12T01:00:00.000Z","heat":4.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-12T02:00:00.000Z","heat":4.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-12T03:00:00.000Z","heat":4.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-12T04:00:00.000Z","heat":4.3,"particip